    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your empire among the stars in this relaxing single-player RTS. Command fleets, manage planetary infrastructure, and research new technologies while enjoying a clear overview of your domain through minimalist visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/33ac247fa2679b12f68e0f7afbd243ce.poster.avif?t=1755532756\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/33ac247fa2679b12f68e0f7afbd243ce.webm?t=1755532756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/33ac247fa2679b12f68e0f7afbd243ce.mp4?t=1755532756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your empire's infrastructure and resources across multiple planets. Each world offers limited building space and requires careful power management - insufficient electricity will slow down production and defensive capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command A Powerful Fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and command different spacecraft types, from civilian colony ships to military vessels. Combat follows an intuitive rock-paper-scissors system, where unit types counter each other but can overcome their weaknesses through technological advancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research New Technologies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct research facilities to generate scientific knowledge and unlock new technologies. Upgrade your buildings, improve your units, and advance your civilization's capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Distinct Species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/75380759618024614a048d71551e8275.avif?t=1755532756\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between the resourceful Hoomans, the adaptable Fungoreptis, or the rare mineral-dependent Octosects - each offering unique playstyles and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign And Skirmish Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/ad602cb160c350d5a4a5a458f50a8ff7.avif?t=1755532756\" width=616 height=400 /></span>Explore a non-linear campaign where each completed mission unlocks new challenges in neighboring star systems, from tutorial missions to complex scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or dive into highly replayable skirmish matches on randomized maps featuring anything imaginable - navigate dense asteroid belts, harness the resources of multiple star systems, and adapt your strategy around black holes and space nebulae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Comfort</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable game speed to match your preferred pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair AI opponent that doesn't rely on cheating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear, minimalist interface providing complete oversight of your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging combat system that minimizes micro-management</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your empire among the stars in this relaxing single-player RTS. Command fleets, manage planetary infrastructure, and research new technologies while enjoying a clear overview of your domain through minimalist visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/33ac247fa2679b12f68e0f7afbd243ce.poster.avif?t=1755532756\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/33ac247fa2679b12f68e0f7afbd243ce.webm?t=1755532756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/33ac247fa2679b12f68e0f7afbd243ce.mp4?t=1755532756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your empire's infrastructure and resources across multiple planets. Each world offers limited building space and requires careful power management - insufficient electricity will slow down production and defensive capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command A Powerful Fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and command different spacecraft types, from civilian colony ships to military vessels. Combat follows an intuitive rock-paper-scissors system, where unit types counter each other but can overcome their weaknesses through technological advancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research New Technologies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct research facilities to generate scientific knowledge and unlock new technologies. Upgrade your buildings, improve your units, and advance your civilization's capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Distinct Species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/75380759618024614a048d71551e8275.avif?t=1755532756\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between the resourceful Hoomans, the adaptable Fungoreptis, or the rare mineral-dependent Octosects - each offering unique playstyles and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign And Skirmish Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346480/extras/ad602cb160c350d5a4a5a458f50a8ff7.avif?t=1755532756\" width=616 height=400 /></span>Explore a non-linear campaign where each completed mission unlocks new challenges in neighboring star systems, from tutorial missions to complex scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or dive into highly replayable skirmish matches on randomized maps featuring anything imaginable - navigate dense asteroid belts, harness the resources of multiple star systems, and adapt your strategy around black holes and space nebulae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Comfort</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable game speed to match your preferred pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair AI opponent that doesn't rely on cheating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear, minimalist interface providing complete oversight of your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging combat system that minimizes micro-management</p></li></ul>",
